Begin Object Class=/Script/CoreUObject.Interface Name="BPI_RaceProgression"
End Object

/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - Blueprint Interface: BPI_RaceProgression
Asset Path: /Game/Blueprints/Core/BPI_RaceProgression
Target: AVELOCITYXGameMode, AVELOCITYXPlayerController, HUD & Split Timers
================================================================================

INTERFACE FUNCTIONS:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. OnStartLineCrossed:
   Inputs:
     - PassingVehicle (Actor): Reference to the vehicle crossing the start line
     - StartTimestamp (Float): World time seconds at start

2. OnCheckpointPassed:
   Inputs:
     - CheckpointIndex (Integer): 1 to N milestone sequence
     - DistanceKm (Float): Distance from start line in kilometers (e.g., 5.0, 10.0, 15.0...)
     - SplitTime (Float): Elapsed race time from Start Line
     - SpeedKPH (Float): Vehicle velocity at moment of passing
     - SpeedMPH (Float): Vehicle velocity in MPH
     - PassingVehicle (Actor): Vehicle reference

3. OnFinishLineCrossed:
   Inputs:
     - PassingVehicle (Actor)
     - TotalRaceTime (Float): Final completed course time
     - TopSpeedKPH (Float): Peak speed recorded across the 50km run
================================================================================
*/
